{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-10","kind":"proposition","title":"构造长度或平方不可公度的线段","englishTitle":"To find two straight lines incommensurable, the one in length only, and the other in square also, with an assigned straight line.","book":10,"number":10,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.10","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.10/","group":"prop_1","sourceNumber":10,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-10@raw-b49f654e34d83fb6","contentId":"euclid-10-10","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b49f654e34d83fb60687942d75cd6827891b8f77bcabd78d2b3ee409c0b2240c","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-10.statement","euclid-10-10.construction.1","euclid-10-10.construction.2","euclid-10-10.proof.1","euclid-10-10.construction.3","euclid-10-10.proof.2","euclid-10-10.proof.3","euclid-10-10.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-10.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-10","revisionId":"euclid-10-10@raw-b49f654e34d83fb6","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"20c310e9edf3a7633787776ac0d92ff77508fd3a9bbcd4ae9ed005772ddf438b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To find two straight lines incommensurable, the one in length only, and the other in square also, with an assigned straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"找到两条不可公度线,一条只长,另一条正方形也长,有一条指定的直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-10.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-10","revisionId":"euclid-10-10@raw-b49f654e34d83fb6","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c34ca7d8c1d95ce24bf86d8d892059ff362f1e6bbadf06cfeecb28118a457f6b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A be the assigned straight line; thus it is required to find two straight lines incommensurable, the one in length only, and the other in square also, with A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A线成为指定的直线;因此,需要找到两条直线不可公度,一条只长,另一条在正方形,还有A。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-10.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-10","revisionId":"euclid-10-10@raw-b49f654e34d83fb6","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"694cfc1ca30cb79eec612ca4d4ecb7b7ad584f11ea2ca0c0afc9ed22b57b67eb","citations":["euclid-10-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let two numbers B, C be set out which have not to one another the ratio which a square number has to a square number, that is, which are not similar plane numbers; and let it be contrived that, as B is to C, so is the square on A to the square on D —for we have learnt how to do this— [[X. 6, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-6)] therefore the square on A is commensurable with the square on D. [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"B,C数字,如果相互之间没有平方数比,即平方数比,即不是相似平面数;并且假设B比与C比等于A正方形比与D正方形比——因为我们知道如何做到这一点——因此,A正方形比与D可公度比是可公度 [[X. 6, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-6)] [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-10.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-10","revisionId":"euclid-10-10@raw-b49f654e34d83fb6","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e8be857c734293785a6fad3f25e5615b0b0ab255eb5e74f42018a90e567dff93","citations":["euclid-10-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since B has not to C the ratio which a square number has to a square number, therefore neither has the square on A to the square on D the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore A is incommensurable in length with D. [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于B的比例为平方数,而平方数的比例为平方数,而平方数的比例为平方数,C的比例为平方数,D的比例为正方形,正方形的比例为正方形,D的比例为平方数,A的比例为不可公度,D的比例为不可公度。 [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-10.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-10-10","revisionId":"euclid-10-10@raw-b49f654e34d83fb6","order":4,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"25d8eb959a063612a4e8dc4b1f464929661345fc1861ade2437e579668b4ebc5","citations":["euclid-5-def-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let E be taken a mean proportional between A, D; therefore, as A is to D, so is the square on A to the square on E. [[V. Def. 9](/principles/euclid-5-def-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"E比A,D,E等于比例中项,A比D等于A比正方形比正方形比E [[V. Def. 9](/principles/euclid-5-def-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-10.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-10","revisionId":"euclid-10-10@raw-b49f654e34d83fb6","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"72dbb6b2ee85a3e48d974c1efd6ef7c0d5c083f3da27271c8969fcfd562ec757","citations":["euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But A is incommensurable in length with D; therefore the square on A is also incommensurable with the square on E; [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)] therefore A is incommensurable in square with E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但A的长度为不可公度,D的长度为D;因此,A的正方形也是不可公度,E的正方形也是不可公度;因此,正方形的不可公度是不可公度,E是不可公度。 [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-10.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-10","revisionId":"euclid-10-10@raw-b49f654e34d83fb6","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"45fe0d112a40ed58ebfeac462fe5b7916fdf8d8344d0705e4ac0463e028c9b13","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore two straight lines D, E have been found incommensurable, D in length only, and E in square and of course in length also, with the assigned straight line A.]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,发现两条D、E直线只有不可公度,D,正方形,当然还有E,指定的直线A。 ]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-10.source","contentId":"euclid-10-10","revisionId":"euclid-10-10@raw-b49f654e34d83fb6","order":7,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b41f07b63a246106d99c9aa1cfbc1e3db82d3609959c32268b61355b6b59e4e9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.10/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.10\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-10:euclid-10-6:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-10","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-10.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-6","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.10","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2